  "html": "<a class=\"skip\" href=\"#main\">Skip to content</a><div id=\"template-bar\">Free HTML template. <a href=\"index.html\" download=\"university.html\">Download this template (free)</a> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <a href=\"https://mmrahmanbappi.github.io/100-free-html-templates/\">See all free templates</a></div><main id=\"main\"><section class=\"hero\" aria-labelledby=\"h1\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1562774053-701939374585?w=2000&q=75&auto=format&fit=crop\" alt=\"\" width=\"2000\" height=\"1333\" fetchpriority=\"high\"><header class=\"wrap nav\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"logo\">Northgate University</a><nav aria-label=\"Main\"><ul class=\"menu\" id=\"menu\"><li><a href=\"#courses\">Courses</a></li><li><a href=\"#life\">Campus life</a></li><li><a href=\"#apply\">How to apply</a></li></ul></nav><button class=\"burger\" aria-label=\"Open menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"menu\">☰</button></header><div class=\"wrap hc\"><h1 id=\"h1\">Find the course that <em>fits your life.</em></h1><p>140 degrees across science, arts, business and health. Study full time, part time or online, on a green campus 10 minutes from the city centre.</p><form class=\"hs\" id=\"hsf\" role=\"search\" aria-label=\"Search courses\"><label for=\"hq\">Search courses</label><input id=\"hq\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"Try nursing, law or computer science\"><button type=\"submit\">Search</button></form></div></section><div class=\"nums\" aria-label=\"Key facts\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div><b>18,400</b><span>students from 96 countries</span></div><div><b>93%</b><span>in work or study 15 months after graduating</span></div><div><b>140</b><span>undergraduate and postgraduate courses</span></div><div><b>£3.2m</b><span>in scholarships each year</span></div></div></div><section id=\"courses\" aria-labelledby=\"c1\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"sh\"><h2 id=\"c1\">Course finder</h2><p>Filter by level, subject and how you'd like to study. Add courses to your shortlist to compare them later.</p></div><div class=\"fd\"><form class=\"fl\" id=\"ff\" aria-label=\"Course filters\"><h3>Filter courses</h3><label for=\"q\">Keyword</label><input id=\"q\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"Course name\"><label for=\"lv\">Level</label><select id=\"lv\"><option value=\"\">All levels</option><option>Undergraduate</option><option>Postgraduate</option></select><label for=\"sb\">Subject</label><select id=\"sb\"><option value=\"\">All subjects</option><option>Business</option><option>Computing</option><option>Health</option><option>Arts and humanities</option><option>Science</option><option>Law</option></select><fieldset><legend>Study mode</legend><label class=\"ck\"><input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"Full time\" checked> Full time</label><label class=\"ck\"><input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"Part time\" checked> Part time</label><label class=\"ck\"><input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"Online\" checked> Online</label></fieldset><button type=\"button\" class=\"rs\" id=\"rs\">Clear all filters</button></form><div><div class=\"rh\" aria-live=\"polite\"><span id=\"cnt\"></span><span class=\"sl\" id=\"sl\">Shortlist: 0</span></div><div id=\"res\"></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"life\" id=\"life\" aria-labelledby=\"l1\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"sh\"><h2 id=\"l1\">Campus life</h2><p>A 60-acre campus with a lake, a 24-hour library and 120 student clubs.</p></div><div class=\"lg\"><figure><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1541339907198-e08756dedf3f?w=1000&q=75&auto=format&fit=crop\" alt=\"Graduates throwing their caps in the air at sunset\" width=\"1000\" height=\"750\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption><b>Graduation on the lawn</b>Every July, with families from around the world</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1427504494785-3a9ca7044f45?w=700&q=75&auto=format&fit=crop\" alt=\"Student walking between tall library shelves\" width=\"700\" height=\"525\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption><b>24-hour library</b>1.2 million books and quiet study rooms</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1524178232363-1fb2b075b655?w=700&q=75&auto=format&fit=crop\" alt=\"Students in a lecture hall listening to a talk\" width=\"700\" height=\"525\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption><b>Small seminar groups</b>Average of 18 students per class</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1571260899304-425eee4c7efc?w=700&q=75&auto=format&fit=crop\" alt=\"Group of students with books and folders chatting\" width=\"700\" height=\"525\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption><b>Student support</b>Mental health, money and careers help, all free</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1543269865-cbf427effbad?w=700&q=75&auto=format&fit=crop\" alt=\"Students laughing together around a table\" width=\"700\" height=\"525\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption><b>120 student clubs</b>From climbing to cooking, or start your own</figcaption></figure></div></div></section><section class=\"apply\" id=\"apply\" aria-labelledby=\"a1\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"sh\"><h2 id=\"a1\">How to apply</h2><p>For undergraduate courses starting in September 2027.</p></div><ol class=\"steps\"><li><h3>Pick your courses</h3><p>Use the course finder, come to an open day on 17 October or 21 November, and talk to current students.</p></li><li><h3>Apply online</h3><p>Apply through the national admissions service by 28 January 2027. Our course codes are listed above.</p></li><li><h3>Get your offer</h3><p>Most decisions arrive within 4 weeks. Some courses, like nursing and art, have an interview first.</p></li><li><h3>Accept and arrive</h3><p>Accept your place, apply for your room and join us for Welcome Week in late September.</p></li></ol></div></section><section class=\"cta\" aria-label=\"Open days\"><div class=\"wrap\"><h2>Come to an open day. Lunch is on us.</h2><a class=\"btn w\" href=\"#apply\">Book an open day</a></div></section></main><footer><div class=\"wrap\"><p>© <span id=\"yr\"></span> Northgate University, Northgate Road, Chesterford</p><p><a href=\"https://unsplash.com\">Photos: Unsplash</a> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <a href=\"https://mmrahmanbappi.github.io/100-free-html-templates/\">More free templates</a></p></div></footer>",
