  "html": "<a class=\"skip\" href=\"#main\">Skip to content</a><div id=\"template-bar\">Free HTML template. <a href=\"index.html\" download=\"ebook-download.html\">Download this template (free)</a> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <a href=\"https://mmrahmanbappi.github.io/100-free-html-templates/\">See all free templates</a></div><header><nav class=\"wrap nav\" aria-label=\"Main\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"logo\">The Calm Inbox</a><ul class=\"menu\" id=\"menu\"><li><a href=\"#preview\">Preview</a></li><li><a href=\"#get\">Get the guide</a></li></ul><button class=\"burger\" aria-label=\"Open menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"menu\">☰</button></nav></header><main id=\"main\"><section class=\"hero\" id=\"get\" aria-labelledby=\"h1\"><div class=\"wrap hg\"><div><h1 id=\"h1\">Get to inbox zero in 20 minutes a day.</h1><p>A free 42-page guide for busy people who spend too much of their day on email. Simple habits, ready-made replies and a weekly routine.</p><ul class=\"chk\"><li>The 3-folder system that replaces 40 labels</li><li>18 copy-and-paste replies for common emails</li><li>How to say no without sounding rude</li><li>A 20-minute daily routine that sticks</li></ul><form class=\"form\" id=\"df\" aria-label=\"Download the guide\"><label for=\"dn\">First name</label><input id=\"dn\" required autocomplete=\"given-name\"><label for=\"de\">Email</label><input id=\"de\" type=\"email\" required autocomplete=\"email\"><label for=\"dr\">I mostly work in</label><select id=\"dr\"><option>An office team</option><option>My own business</option><option>Remote or freelance</option><option>Something else</option></select><button class=\"btn\" type=\"submit\">Send me the free guide</button><p class=\"fine\">No spam. One helpful email a week, unsubscribe any time.</p><div class=\"ok\" id=\"ok\" hidden aria-live=\"polite\"><p id=\"okt\"></p><a class=\"btn y\" id=\"dl\" href=\"#\" download=\"the-calm-inbox-sample.txt\">Download now</a></div></form></div><div class=\"book\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"cover\"><small>FREE GUIDE</small><b>The Calm Inbox</b><span>by Hannah Price</span></div></div></div></section><div class=\"stats\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div><b>31,000</b><span>downloads so far</span></div><div><b>4.8 of 5</b><span>from 1,200 reader ratings</span></div><div><b>42 pages</b><span>about 45 minutes to read</span></div></div></div><section id=\"preview\" aria-labelledby=\"p1\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"sh\"><h2 id=\"p1\">Read a little first</h2><p>Pick a chapter to see how it starts.</p></div><div class=\"tabs\" id=\"tabs\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Chapters\"></div><article class=\"page\" aria-live=\"polite\"><span class=\"n\" id=\"cn\"></span><h3 id=\"ch\"></h3><div class=\"fade\"><p id=\"cp\"></p></div></article></div></section><section aria-label=\"Reader comment\"><div class=\"wrap q\"><blockquote>\"I went from 2,000 unread emails to zero in a week, and I've stayed there for three months. The reply templates alone are worth it.\"</blockquote><cite>Office manager, Leeds</cite><p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"#get\">Get the free guide</a></p></div></section></main><footer><div class=\"wrap\"><p>© <span id=\"yr\"></span> Hannah Price, The Calm Inbox</p><p><a href=\"https://unsplash.com\">Photos: Unsplash</a> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <a href=\"https://mmrahmanbappi.github.io/100-free-html-templates/\">More free templates</a></p></div></footer>",
